<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA (373 TO WIN) 49-0 V SRI LANKA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA (373 TO WIN) 49-0 V SRI LANKA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, needing 373 to win the second and final test against Sri Lanka, were 49-0 at the close on the fourth day on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 332 and 415-7 declared, India 375 and 49-0.</p>
